      "body": "Adds SINC (0x9C8cd8d3961F445D653713dE65C6578bE11668e7) on Base mainnet.\n\n- Native Base ERC-20 (nobridge: true)\n- Website: https://getsincor.com\n- Sourcify full-match verified contracts\n- CertiK Skynet 97/100\n- Fixed 100M supply, 8 decimals, no mint/admin keys\n- Official buy venue: bonding curve 0x75dE341a2BC81806198364F125d4Cde36527619C\n\nDo not price from rogue Uniswap V2 pair 0x85372932f9b151a076815d92cf71a97980ffd667.",
