      "body": "### Token Addition Request: GOSUN\n\n- **Token Name**: GOSUN\n- **Symbol**: GOSUN\n- **Decimals**: 18\n- **Network**: Base Mainnet (Chain ID 8453)\n- **Contract Address**: `0xA0F90aC270d22F42F47A94CA53Bd79d81c385359`\n- **Pool on Aerodrome**: WETH / GOSUN Basic Volatile (`0x4EeC77555a08Cae3B4fA8c44Da2434Ae7eAe8E65`)\n- **Liquidity Status**: Seed liquidity successfully deposited on Aerodrome\n- **Official Theoretical Portal**: https://gosun.bond\n- **Omnichain Infrastructure**: https://www.7861618.xyz\n- **Official X**: https://x.com/Gosun_Capital\n- **Amazon Publication**: https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0GPM96JFH\n\nAll metadata and 256x256 logo have been formatted according to the Superchain Token List specification.\n",
      "repository": "ethereum-optimism/ethereum-optimism.github.io",
